        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVGEO19, Keyed Georgetown Lever with Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Entry Georgetown Lever with Fifth Avenue Plate will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. It has a traditional look that is great for classic homes. The Keyed Georgetown Lever with Fifth Avenue Plate is a single cylinder door lock, meaning the door is opened by a thumb latch on the exterior and by a lever on the interior. On the deadbolt, there is a keyed lock cylinder for use on the outside of the door while a thumb turn is used to lock the door on the interior. This Georgetown Leverset with Tall Fifth Avenue Plate is specifically designed for taller doors or those doors in large rooms that need a big presence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/georgetown-lever-with-fifth-avenue-plate-grandeur-favgeo19\"><b>Georgetown Lever with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Georgetown Lever with Fifth Avenue Rose Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Georgetown Leverset with Tall Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVGEO19ENT-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262394\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVGEO19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
